            <ArticleTitle>Pharmacology of bronchodilators.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>54-7, 59</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the UK, diseases that cause airflow obstruction are common. About 5.1 million people receive treatment for asthma and about 600,000 people are diagnosed as having chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), although this is likely to be an underestimate (British Thoracic Society, 2001).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
